multi-channel integration such as <a href="https://besanh.github.io/anhle_api/blog/chat" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chat</a>chat, SMS, ZNS and email, it also enables companies to reach,
engage and serve customers in the best possible way.</p><p><img loading="lazy" alt="Contact" src="/assets/images/contact-2e54bcf47a764790d75f02506d0fb3ec.png" width="2364" height="1444" class="img_ev3q"></p><p><img loading="lazy" alt="Contact" src="/assets/images/ticket-e8a96810b25a4c4dd77ffab6b7586e9f.png" width="2358" height="1112" class="img_ev3q"></p><p><img loading="lazy" alt="Contact" src="/assets/images/unit-82120a773c2a0c6c521170ca8ebfc514.png" width="2320" height="1446" class="img_ev3q"></p>]]></content>
